        "Description": "Good evening 47. Remember this client we helped escape from this mysterious lab in Chongqing a while back? Well, he&apos;s done some research, and he&apos;s willing to pay us millions if we work with him to take down this business. He&apos;s learned that they&apos;ve beefed up their security. Our target is the head of the business himself, Hush. Then we have Hush&apos;s own personal bodyguard Mogwai, and a really important part of his success, a sniper who&apos;s hunting you down all the time. Good luck and hunting agent.",
